  "headline": "Amiodarone hydrochloride is not on FDA's shortage list; both Corvale sites use product from Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407), which received a VAI inspection on 2026-07-16",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E14", "E12"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows amiodarone hydrochloride is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 144 tablets of the 200 mg presentation, providing 9.8 days of supply at current use.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 268 tablets of the same presentation, providing 17.8 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both sites' inventory is labeled by Bryant Ranch Prepack (NDC 71335194204) and traces to FEI 1000519407.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of that plant ended 2026-07-16 and was classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E12", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant received an OAI classification in 2009 and a Warning Letter in 2010, but subsequent inspections through 2026 have been VAI.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E13", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ranked transfer option moves 57 tablets from Corvale General to Corvale East, leaving each site with at least 14 days on hand.",
